# ─── 密钥与凭证 ───
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# ─── 脚本备份文件（改路径/批量替换前的可回滚副本，不进 GitHub）───
*.bak
*.prerename_bak
*.prerename_repos_bak
*.polish_bak

# ─── 操作系统隐藏文件 ───
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─── Node.js ───
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ─── Obsidian 排除 ───
.obsidian/

# ─── Syncthing 同步（本地同步工具，不进 GitHub）───
.stfolder/
.stignore
*.sync-conflict-*
.stversions/

# ─── 本地脚本输出 ───
scripts/*.log
scripts/*.tmp

# ─── 编辑器临时文件 ───
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/settings.json
.vscode/launch.json

# ─── 大型二进制文件（机械设计 / 3D / CAD）───
# 注意：Git 的 ignore 匹配大小写敏感，Windows/SolidWorks 常导出大写扩展名，
# 每个类型必须大小写两种形式都写，否则大写后缀的文件会漏进版本库。
*.SLDASM
*.sldasm
*.SLDPRT
*.sldprt
*.SLDDRW
*.slddrw
*.x_t
*.X_T
*.x_b
*.X_B
*.STEP
*.step
*.STP
*.stp
*.IGS
*.igs
*.iges
*.IGES
*.dwg
*.DWG
*.Dwg
*.zip
*.ZIP
*.rar
*.RAR
*.7z
*.7Z
*.xlsx
*.XLSX
*.xlsm
*.XLSM
*.pdf
*.PDF

# ─── WorkBuddy 工作区 ───
.workbuddy/*
!.workbuddy/memory/
